sort: 3
id: Not003
text: File corrupted: Could not use <file name>.\n\nThis message is generated when the information\nin <file name> does not match the User information.\n(User information says you are <user name>.)\n\nClick Quit to close the program completely.  Reboot\nyour computer, and try again.\n\nIf that does not work, the integrity of the file can\nprobably be restored by your instructor.\n

